			<div class="content" id="post-content-4214315">
									

<p>Well, here it is. Another attempt to make an X-Man work.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Inspiration&nbsp;for&nbsp;this</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">.....</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Let me get one thing out the way: Yes, I'm aware of the entire X-Man Syndrome that no doubt pops into your mind upon first glance of this article. That's sort've the point. I thoroughly enjoy Humanoid SCP's, or at least the ones done right. I think the idea of some of these humanoid SCPs trying to become &quot;heroes&quot; or &quot;villians&quot; would become natural, especially with its current prevalence in pop culture. I always found the Foundation as the harsh reality that would face these beings if they were real. Any who&#8230;</p>
<p>My favorite film is Unbreakable. In particular, I love the implication that art more often imitates life than vice versa. I wanted to explore this with the Superman character concept and, hopefully, break the illusion of heroic vigilantism.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Image&nbsp;Credit</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">------------</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Mugshot<br />
<a href="https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archivo:Yanni.jpg">https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archivo:Yanni.jpg</a></p>
<p>Broken Arm<br />
<a href="https://farm1.staticflickr.com/110/291472553_0d883544c6_b.jpg">https://farm1.staticflickr.com/110/291472553_0d883544c6_b.jpg</a></p>
<p>&quot;Flying&quot; Man (Yours Truly Created It)<br />
Components I used</p>
<ul>
<li>Factory</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://pxhere.com/en/photo/677420">https://pxhere.com/en/photo/677420</a></p>
<ul>
