</ul>
<p><a href="https://pixabay.com/vectors/automobile-transport-car-lantern-1029929/">https://pixabay.com/vectors/automobile-transport-car-lantern-1029929/</a></p>
<ul>
<li>Man</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://pxhere.com/en/photo/1038945">https://pxhere.com/en/photo/1038945</a></p>
<p>Knife<br />
<a href="https://www.knifeblog.com/what-to-do-with-a-bent-knife/">https://www.knifeblog.com/what-to-do-with-a-bent-knife/</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Special, special thanks are given to Pachayachachic for some amazing ideas on where to take this along with TheMightyMcB, who greenlit the concept along with Zyn. Oh, and I can't forget about BlackMagicFine and RockTeethMothEyes who critiqued this painstakingly well.</p>
<p>Cheers!</p>

